(7445628, 1178014, 156466, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of the B&amp;W contributing to the chaotic aspect of this, but at the same time it''s almost too much chaos with my eyes never landing anywhere.</td>', 'I love the idea of the B&W contributing to the chaotic aspect of this, but at the same time it''s almost too much chaos with my eyes never landing anywhere.', '2016-03-23 13:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445629, 1178016, 156466, '<td valign="top">I really don''t want to like the negative effect here.  I don''t want to, but I do.  It works.</td>', 'I really don''t want to like the negative effect here.  I don''t want to, but I do.  It works.', '2016-03-23 13:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445630, 1178008, 156466, '<td valign="top">It appears that you were left with the same level of "flora" that I was, and experienced the same problem I had with moss - it''s just hard to show in a photograph. Did you rotate this 90 degrees right?  It works better for me the other way if you did, and wish you''re rotated it left if you didn''t. Tough to find something in this that draws you in but I appreciate you trying to do something different.</td>', 'It appears that you were left with the same level of "flora" that I was, and experienced the same problem I had with moss - it''s just hard to show in a photograph. Did you rotate this 90 degrees right?  It works better for me the other way if you did, and wish you''re rotated it left if you didn''t. Tough to find something in this that draws you in but I appreciate you trying to do something different.', '2016-03-23 13:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445631, 1177884, 156466, '<td valign="top">I really like the scene but not the processing.  Greens and blues are oversaturated and I''d like a little more detail.  Maybe darken the sides a bit as well.  There''s a 7 in here somewhere.</td>', 'I really like the scene but not the processing.  Greens and blues are oversaturated and I''d like a little more detail.  Maybe darken the sides a bit as well.  There''s a 7 in here somewhere.', '2016-03-23 13:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445632, 1177678, 156466, '<td valign="top">Would have been a very good "also ran" without the loose seed.  With it it''s in my top 2.</td>', 'Would have been a very good "also ran" without the loose seed.  With it it''s in my top 2.', '2016-03-23 13:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
