(7445779, 1177922, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nicely balanced composition. Very architecturally pleasing! Only thing I could think of to improve it would be to try to even out the light a little more in post. It''s somewhat darker on the subject. Great color and simplicity.</td>', 'Nicely balanced composition. Very architecturally pleasing! Only thing I could think of to improve it would be to try to even out the light a little more in post. It''s somewhat darker on the subject. Great color and simplicity.', '2016-03-24 20:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445780, 1177943, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice and dreamy soft. I maybe would have tried out a square crop to fill up the space!</td>', 'Nice and dreamy soft. I maybe would have tried out a square crop to fill up the space!', '2016-03-24 20:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445784, 1177884, 10785, '<td valign="top">Love how nature is taking over and turning this rugged area back to a colorful wonder! Nice composition and lines. I could only suggest dialing down the saturation on the green color channel a bit to see what that does, but the color really does pop! The red, rusty tracks are really complimented with the green grass.</td>', 'Love how nature is taking over and turning this rugged area back to a colorful wonder! Nice composition and lines. I could only suggest dialing down the saturation on the green color channel a bit to see what that does, but the color really does pop! The red, rusty tracks are really complimented with the green grass.', '2016-03-24 20:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445802, 1177922, 18915, '<td valign="top">nicely composed. I would have removed the plastic white thing in the Left pot.<br/> <br/>and I like the barely noticeable lizard on the wall behind the plant</td>', 'nicely composed. I would have removed the plastic white thing in the Left pot. and I like the barely noticeable lizard on the wall behind the plant', '2016-03-24 21:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445803, 1177999, 18915, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the sharpness of the main subject and the motion of the flakes behind it. nicely done</td>', 'I love the contrast between the sharpness of the main subject and the motion of the flakes behind it. nicely done', '2016-03-24 21:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445804, 1177685, 18915, '<td valign="top">nicely composed, wonderful colours.<br/>I found the image to be quite grainy/noisy.</td>', 'nicely composed, wonderful colours.I found the image to be quite grainy/noisy.', '2016-03-24 21:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445808, 1177670, 18915, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF for the softness of the background but with the severe shallowness, the subject seems to be missing some sharpness.<br/> <br/>I do really like the warm tone to the overall image a lot.</td>', 'I like the DOF for the softness of the background but with the severe shallowness, the subject seems to be missing some sharpness. I do really like the warm tone to the overall image a lot.', '2016-03-24 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445810, 1178016, 18915, '<td valign="top">interesting choice of Post processing.</td>', 'interesting choice of Post processing.', '2016-03-24 21:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445812, 1177799, 18915, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but the image seems a little soft and lacks detail/sharpness.</td>', 'I like the composition but the image seems a little soft and lacks detail/sharpness.', '2016-03-24 21:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7445813, 1178014, 18915, '<td valign="top">excellent choice in name for Photo. there is so much going on, so much content. very interesting photo and good eye to choose this for the challenge</td>', 'excellent choice in name for Photo. there is so much going on, so much content. very interesting photo and good eye to choose this for the challenge', '2016-03-24 21:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
