(7446186, 1177884, 163430, '<td valign="top">I definitely like the approach. The processing is a but too painterly for my taste, but the other elements (idea, composition..) trump this.</td>', 'I definitely like the approach. The processing is a but too painterly for my taste, but the other elements (idea, composition..) trump this.', '2016-03-28 11:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446187, 1177919, 163430, '<td valign="top">Street photo in a floral challenge. Brave!<br/>It meets the challenge just fine in my book.</td>', 'Street photo in a floral challenge. Brave!It meets the challenge just fine in my book.', '2016-03-28 11:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446188, 1177704, 163430, '<td valign="top">I see a horse''s ass on this photo :-(</td>', 'I see a horse''s ass on this photo :-(', '2016-03-28 11:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446189, 1177927, 163430, '<td valign="top">Although it''s a cliche concept, i like the high-key/backlight approach and the composition. The velvety soft lighting is perfect, and the blinds add nice detail to the background.</td>', 'Although it''s a cliche concept, i like the high-key/backlight approach and the composition. The velvety soft lighting is perfect, and the blinds add nice detail to the background.', '2016-03-28 11:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446190, 1177777, 163430, '<td valign="top">It''s a cliche, but not quite, which i like. I only with it was cropped/composed differently. The negative space below is what''s bothering me.</td>', 'It''s a cliche, but not quite, which i like. I only with it was cropped/composed differently. The negative space below is what''s bothering me.', '2016-03-28 11:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446192, 1178007, 163430, '<td valign="top">Is her name Flora? :-)<br/> <br/>I like the fact that it''s not a macro close-up up of petals or other cliche. I like this a lot. Very original idea. The execution, on the other side, is sub-par. I miss some colour in the photo. Or maybe it''s the white balance that is a bit off. It''s too green in the middle and too brown on the outside.</td>', 'Is her name Flora? :-) I like the fact that it''s not a macro close-up up of petals or other cliche. I like this a lot. Very original idea. The execution, on the other side, is sub-par. I miss some colour in the photo. Or maybe it''s the white balance that is a bit off. It''s too green in the middle and too brown on the outside.', '2016-03-28 11:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446194, 1177684, 163430, '<td valign="top">One of the better cliche entries in this challenge.</td>', 'One of the better cliche entries in this challenge.', '2016-03-28 12:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446195, 1177844, 163430, '<td valign="top">Ha! That''s an interesting approach.</td>', 'Ha! That''s an interesting approach.', '2016-03-28 12:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446198, 1178000, 163430, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit too centered framing. Just a bit.</td>', 'Maybe a bit too centered framing. Just a bit.', '2016-03-28 12:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7446199, 1177992, 163430, '<td valign="top">Since the photo was validated, you obviously did some trickery with the text on a sheet of paper. Interesting and very unusual approach. Unfortunately, it does not add to the effect of the photo at all :-(</td>', 'Since the photo was validated, you obviously did some trickery with the text on a sheet of paper. Interesting and very unusual approach. Unfortunately, it does not add to the effect of the photo at all :-(', '2016-03-28 12:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
